Arara Code: generic hook for extension-supplied default view container order.

Why a patch: the extension API cannot reorder native secondary sidebar containers.
The extension detects installed CLIs and supplies ids; the core only orders those
containers and preserves manual ordering while the supplied default is unchanged.
No provider names, CLI detection or product heuristics live in this public patch.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/browser/parts/paneCompositeBar.ts

